  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the Central Teacher Eligibility Test (CTET) September 2026 examination. Candidates can also check all the details on the official  website. The online application process for CTET September Recruitment 2026 has started on 25 August 2026, and candidates can apply till 01 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for CTET September Online Form 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Central Board of Secondary Education (CSBE)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">CTET September Online Form 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <b>10 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date : <strong>15-18 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Form Re-Open</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>25 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>01 September 2026</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <b>Before Exam</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fees For Single Paper</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC : <strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PwD : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffcc00;\">Fees For Both Paper</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC : <strong>Rs.1200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PwD : <strong>Rs. 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CTET September Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Minimum : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>CTET September Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.4911%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Class&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.4911%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Primary Stage (Class I to V)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.5089%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who are Senior Secondary or its Equivalent with at least 50% or 45% marks/Passed&nbsp; or appearing diploma in Elementary Education as per NCTE 2002 Norms / B.El.Ed (04 Years Course)/Diploma in education(Special Course ,for 02 Years)/ D.Ed(1 Year)/Diploma in Elementary Education(1 Year) will be eligible for CTET Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.4911%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Secondary Stage (Class VI to VIII)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.5089%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree (with at least 45% or 50% marks) /passed or appearing in final year of 2 year Diploma in elementary Education/Diploma in Education/B.El.Ed /B.SC.Ed /B.A Ed. /B.Ed. will be eligible for this CTET Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>CTET September Online Form 2026 : Mode of Selection&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be Based on Entrance Exam (Paper I &amp; Paper II)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>&nbsp;CTET September Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://ctet.nic.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the CTET before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for CTET September Online Form can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\