 Notification 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The last date to apply online for this recruitment is 01 September 2026.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Age Limit For CTET September Vacancy 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The age of the candidates applying for this recruitment as per CTET September rules, see the post wise age information in the official information.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Qualification For CTET September Online Form 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>To apply for this recruitment, the candidate must have 12th , Graduation pass read the official information completely before applying.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to Apply For CTET September Bharti 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> To apply for this recruitment, first of all you have to go to the Official Sarkari Result which is <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SarkariExam.com</a> and apply through this recruitment page. Through Sarkari Result Official you can apply for many government jobs.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to download the result of CTET September Result 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>All those candidates who had given the exam for this recruitment can now download their result. To download your result, you can download it by entering registration number / roll number and DOB (Date of Birth). The official download link of the result will be made available in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Q. What is CBSE CTET Official Website?<br>\n</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Official Website of CBSE CTET is https://ctet.nic.in/</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n